---
import Layout from "@/layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout title="Your shared watchlist" description="Save YouTube videos, track watch status, and share a thoughtful collection with a friend." showNav={false}>
  <div class="min-h-screen bg-white text-foreground">
    <header class="border-b border-border">
      <nav class="mx-auto flex h-20 max-w-7xl items-center justify-between px-4 sm:px-6">
        <a href="/" class="flex items-center gap-2.5 text-xl font-bold text-primary">
          <img src="/icons/icon-192.png" alt="" aria-hidden="true" class="h-9 w-9 rounded-lg object-contain" />
          SeenTube
        </a>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
          <a href="/explore" class="hidden px-3 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-muted-foreground hover:text-foreground sm:inline-flex">Arigato Labs</a>
          <a href="/login" class="inline-flex h-11 items-center rounded-lg bg-primary px-5 text-sm font-semibold text-white hover:bg-[#e00b41]">Sign in</a>
        </div>
      </nav>
    </header>

    <main>
      <section class="mx-auto grid max-w-7xl items-center gap-12 px-4 py-16 sm:px-6 sm:py-24 lg:grid-cols-[1.02fr_.98fr] lg:py-28">
        <div class="max-w-2xl animate-fade-in">
          <div class="mb-5 inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-[#ffd1da] bg-[#fff5f7] px-3 py-1.5 text-xs font-semibold text-primary">
            <span class="h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-primary"></span> A private watchlist for two
          </div>
          <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold leading-[1.08] tracking-[-0.04em] sm:text-6xl">Save less randomly.<br/><span class="text-primary">Watch more together.</span></h1>
          <p class="mt-6 max-w-xl text-base leading-7 text-muted-foreground sm:text-lg">Collect videos worth watching, organize them beautifully, and see what you and your friend have finished—without losing another link in chat.</p>
          <div class="mt-8 flex flex-col gap-3 sm:flex-row">
            <a href="/login" class="inline-flex h-12 items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-lg bg-primary px-6 text-base font-semibold text-white hover:bg-[#e00b41]">Start your collection <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
            <a href="#how-it-works" class="inline-flex h-12 items-center justify-center rounded-lg border border-foreground px-6 text-base font-medium hover:bg-secondary">See how it works</a>
          </div>
          <p class="mt-4 text-xs text-muted-foreground">Private access · Google sign-in · Built for a shared collection</p>
        </div>

        <div class="relative mx-auto w-full max-w-xl lg:mx-0">
          <div class="absolute -left-5 -top-5 h-24 w-24 rounded-full bg-[#fff0f3]"></div>
          <div class="relative rounded-[24px] border border-border bg-white p-3 elevation-1 sm:p-5">
            <div class="mb-4 flex items-center justify-between px-1"><div><p class="text-xs text-muted-foreground">Shared library</p><h2 class="text-xl font-semibold">Worth watching</h2></div><span class="rounded-full bg-secondary px-3 py-1 text-xs font-medium">12 videos</span></div>
            <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-3">
              <article class="overflow-hidden rounded-lg border border-[#f4d87a] bg-[#fffceb]"><div class="aspect-video bg-[#222] p-4 text-white"><span class="text-xs font-semibold">Design that feels natural</span></div><div class="space-y-2 p-3"><span class="rounded-full bg-white px-2 py-1 text-[10px]">Education</span><p class="line-clamp-2 text-sm font-semibold">Building better digital products</p><span class="text-xs text-muted-foreground">◷ Pending</span></div></article>
              <article class="overflow-hidden rounded-lg border border-[#ffd1da] bg-[#fff5f7]"><div class="aspect-video bg-primary p-4 text-white"><span class="text-xs font-semibold">Ideas worth sharing</span></div><div class="space-y-2 p-3"><span class="rounded-full bg-white px-2 py-1 text-[10px]">Tech</span><p class="line-clamp-2 text-sm font-semibold">The future of creative work</p><span class="text-xs text-primary">◉ Partially watched</span></div></article>
            </div>
            <div class="mt-3 flex items-center justify-between rounded-lg border border-border p-3"><span class="text-sm font-medium">Collection progress</span><span class="text-sm font-semibold text-primary">68%</span></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>


      <section id="how-it-works" class="border-y border-border bg-secondary/60">
        <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 py-16 sm:px-6 sm:py-24">
          <div class="mx-auto max-w-2xl text-center">
            <p class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-primary">Simple by design</p>
            <h2 class="mt-3 text-3xl font-bold tracking-[-0.03em] sm:text-4xl">From shared link to shared memory.</h2>
            <p class="mt-4 text-muted-foreground">No noisy feeds or complicated setup—just one thoughtful place for videos you actually want to watch.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="mt-12 grid gap-4 md:grid-cols-3">
            <article class="rounded-lg border border-border bg-white p-6"><span class="flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-[#fff0f3] font-bold text-primary">1</span><h3 class="mt-5 text-lg font-semibold">Save the good stuff</h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-muted-foreground">Paste a YouTube link and SeenTube brings in its details automatically.</p></article>
            <article class="rounded-lg border border-border bg-white p-6"><span class="flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-[#fff0f3] font-bold text-primary">2</span><h3 class="mt-5 text-lg font-semibold">Keep it organized</h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-muted-foreground">Use categories, tags, and notes so the right video is always easy to find.</p></article>
            <article class="rounded-lg border border-border bg-white p-6"><span class="flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-[#fff0f3] font-bold text-primary">3</span><h3 class="mt-5 text-lg font-semibold">Watch together</h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-muted-foreground">Track pending, partially watched, and completed videos for both people.</p></article>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="mx-auto grid max-w-7xl items-center gap-12 px-4 py-16 sm:px-6 sm:py-24 lg:grid-cols-2">
        <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-3" aria-hidden="true">
          <div class="rounded-lg border border-[#f4d87a] bg-[#fffceb] p-5"><div class="mb-12 h-8 w-8 rounded-full bg-[#f4d87a]"></div><p class="text-xs font-semibold text-muted-foreground">PENDING</p><p class="mt-1 text-lg font-bold">Ready when you are</p></div>
          <div class="mt-8 rounded-lg border border-[#bcebc9] bg-[#f1fcf4] p-5"><div class="mb-12 h-8 w-8 rounded-full bg-[#68c982]"></div><p class="text-xs font-semibold text-muted-foreground">WATCHED</p><p class="mt-1 text-lg font-bold">One more finished</p></div>
          <div class="col-span-2 rounded-lg border border-[#ffd1da] bg-[#fff5f7] p-5"><div class="flex items-center justify-between"><div><p class="text-xs font-semibold text-primary">SHARED PROGRESS</p><p class="mt-1 text-lg font-bold">A collection that moves with you</p></div><span class="text-2xl font-bold text-primary">68%</span></div><div class="mt-4 h-2 overflow-hidden rounded-full bg-white"><div class="h-full w-2/3 rounded-full bg-primary"></div></div></div>
        </div>
        <div class="max-w-xl"><p class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-primary">Made for two</p><h2 class="mt-3 text-3xl font-bold tracking-[-0.03em] sm:text-4xl">Your collection tells a better story than your chat history.</h2><p class="mt-5 text-base leading-7 text-muted-foreground">See what is waiting, what is in progress, and what you have both completed. Every status has a clear visual identity, so the collection stays useful at a glance—even on mobile.</p><ul class="mt-6 space-y-3 text-sm font-medium"><li>✓ Fast, app-like page navigation</li><li>✓ Responsive one- or two-column mobile cards</li><li>✓ A clean shared view without duplicate links</li></ul></div>
      </section>

      <section class="px-4 pb-16 sm:px-6 sm:pb-24"><div class="mx-auto max-w-5xl rounded-[24px] bg-foreground px-6 py-12 text-center text-white sm:px-12 sm:py-16"><p class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-[#ff8ca1]">Your next favorite video is waiting</p><h2 class="mt-3 text-3xl font-bold text-white sm:text-4xl">Build a watchlist worth coming back to.</h2><p class="mx-auto mt-4 max-w-xl text-sm leading-6 text-white/70 sm:text-base">Sign in, save your first video, and turn scattered recommendations into something you can enjoy together.</p><a href="/login" class="mt-7 inline-flex h-12 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-primary px-6 text-base font-semibold text-white hover:bg-[#e00b41]">Get started with SeenTube</a></div></section>
    </main>

    <footer class="border-t border-border">
      <div class="mx-auto flex max-w-7xl flex-col gap-4 px-4 py-8 text-sm text-muted-foreground sm:px-6">
        <nav class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-3 gap-y-2" aria-label="Legal">
          <a href="/about" class="font-medium text-foreground hover:text-primary">About</a>
          <span class="text-border" aria-hidden="true">·</span>
          <a href="/privacy" class="font-medium text-foreground hover:text-primary">Privacy</a>
          <span class="text-border" aria-hidden="true">·</span>
          <a href="/terms" class="font-medium text-foreground hover:text-primary">Terms</a>
          <span class="text-border" aria-hidden="true">·</span>
          <a href="/disclaimer" class="font-medium text-foreground hover:text-primary">Disclaimer</a>
          <span class="text-border" aria-hidden="true">·</span>
          <a href="/contact" class="font-medium text-foreground hover:text-primary">Contact</a>
        </nav>
        <div class="flex flex-col gap-3 sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-between">
          <p>Copyright © 2026 Arigato Labs. All Rights Reserved.</p>
          <a href="/explore" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 font-medium text-foreground hover:text-primary">
            <img src="/arigato-single-logo.png" alt="" class="h-[17px] w-[17px] object-contain" />
            An Arigato Labs product
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </footer>
  </div>
</Layout>